{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/base/core","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:07.440Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azurelinux/base/core/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azurelinux/base/core/about"},"readme":"## About\n\nThis repository contains the official base image for Azure Linux. Use Docker to run a standalone Linux container with core packages pre-installed or use it as a base for your own deployments.\n\n### What is Azure Linux?\n\nAzure Linux is a Linux distribution for Microsoft’s cloud infrastructure and edge products and services. Azure Linux is designed to provide a consistent platform for these devices and services and will enhance Microsoft’s ability to stay current on Linux updates.  \n\nTo learn more about Azure Linux, refer to our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/).\n\n## Featured tags\n\n- `3.0`\n\nThe featured tag is a multi-architecture tag, meaning it allows Docker to automatically select the appropriate image variant (e.g., `x86-64` or `aarch64`) based on your system's architecture, always pointing to the latest version of the images. Additional tags that are specific to Azure Linux build or architecture can be found in the Tags section.\n\n## Usage\n\nTo use this image, run:\n\n    docker run -it --rm mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/base/core:3.0\n\nThe default container startup command is `bash`.\n\n## Support\n\nAzure Linux container images are supported only for internal Microsoft use. For more information please see our [Support Statement](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/-/SUPPORT.md).\n\n## License\n\nThe Azure Linux distribution is provided under the [MIT license](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/-/LICENSE). Individual packages and components are governed by their own licenses included in the package sources available via srpm on [packages.microsoft.com](https://packages.microsoft.com/azurelinux/) or via our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/).\n\n- Legal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice)","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-12T00:59:36.4002622+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"8.1M+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"3.0","digest":"sha256:34a22db497ff34a0f35ca5fc54bd38711d04238a2c1b2f65d35dc9d45dd82584","pushed":"2026-09-12T00:48:45.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260909","digest":"sha256:34a22db497ff34a0f35ca5fc54bd38711d04238a2c1b2f65d35dc9d45dd82584","pushed":"2026-09-12T00:48:40.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260909-arm64","digest":"sha256:d37a88da98fdc73af164ef1995231a3d17ab5865dcf0304805ce093c450ce632","pushed":"2026-09-12T00:48:39.0000000+00:00","size":603,"platforms":["linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260909-amd64","digest":"sha256:c877612270d1ee2d6ab2bc1f64bfe38ab697ac50be325154ee5129fce89c17e4","pushed":"2026-09-12T00:48:34.0000000+00:00","size":603,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260825","digest":"sha256:daa1142fc6b44e27c8112ec6b4c2d579ddb9bc6b3747504e666010a45a51faa4","pushed":"2026-08-26T01:14:19.0000000+00:00","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"3.0.20260825-arm64","digest":"sha256:369e5e5fa4830e50ee2290c65e81cf3e06f2f8